{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 1\u20135 player co-op survival horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a wild jungle, with no clues about what\u2019s going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through the gaps in the trees, you see that you're surrounded by towering walls. The gate opens at dawn and closes at night. You must gather enough supplies and build a base in this relatively safe forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not just to keep warm and fed,<br>but to have shelter when monsters come to invade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/1c6887bb761ebe5e59d023d3c34c1f9c.poster.webp?t=1751052649\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/1c6887bb761ebe5e59d023d3c34c1f9c.webp?t=1751052649\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you're well prepared, venture into the maze filled with unknown dangers.<br>There, you\u2019ll need to gather vital materials, solve complex puzzles, leave markers, and try to push your exploration as far as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/6dd8c33ef76f83c098ff187fb3f68a3c.poster.webp?t=1751052649\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/6dd8c33ef76f83c098ff187fb3f68a3c.webp?t=1751052649\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware \u2014 the real threat lies in the maze itself.<br>You\u2019ll face not only bizarre creatures like aliens and giant spiders,<br>but also terrifying entities like ghosts, spirits that teleport to you when they hear your voice, and relentless cube-like monsters that will hunt you without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/035d6f0f63c5a9e405028876c79aced6.poster.webp?t=1751052649\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/035d6f0f63c5a9e405028876c79aced6.webp?t=1751052649\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There seems to be a mysterious force behind the maze, constantly interfering with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go now \u2014 see if you can escape.<br>And if you can\u2019t\u2026<br>do your best to leave clues for the next ones who enter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go ahead and see if you can escape. If not, try to leave something behind for those who come after you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2812670?t=1751052649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751052649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/80713d216a8ee4515bf8d8b86bb8fd6379c94cb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751052649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/80713d216a8ee4515bf8d8b86bb8fd6379c94cb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751052649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes where characters appear wearing only underwear, with no other nudity depicted.\r\nAdditionally, the game features blood effects when slaughtering pigs and character deaths, which constitute the only violent/gory content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 1\u20135 player co-op survival horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a wild jungle, with no clues about what\u2019s going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through the gaps in the trees, you see that you're surrounded by towering walls. The gate opens at dawn and closes at night. You must gather enough supplies and build a base in this relatively safe forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not just to keep warm and fed,<br>but to have shelter when monsters come to invade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/1c6887bb761ebe5e59d023d3c34c1f9c.poster.webp?t=1751052649\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/1c6887bb761ebe5e59d023d3c34c1f9c.webp?t=1751052649\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you're well prepared, venture into the maze filled with unknown dangers.<br>There, you\u2019ll need to gather vital materials, solve complex puzzles, leave markers, and try to push your exploration as far as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/6dd8c33ef76f83c098ff187fb3f68a3c.poster.webp?t=1751052649\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/6dd8c33ef76f83c098ff187fb3f68a3c.webp?t=1751052649\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware \u2014 the real threat lies in the maze itself.<br>You\u2019ll face not only bizarre creatures like aliens and giant spiders,<br>but also terrifying entities like ghosts, spirits that teleport to you when they hear your voice, and relentless cube-like monsters that will hunt you without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/035d6f0f63c5a9e405028876c79aced6.poster.webp?t=1751052649\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/035d6f0f63c5a9e405028876c79aced6.webp?t=1751052649\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There seems to be a mysterious force behind the maze, constantly interfering with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go now \u2014 see if you can escape.<br>And if you can\u2019t\u2026<br>do your best to leave clues for the next ones who enter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go ahead and see if you can escape. If not, try to leave something behind for those who come after you.</p>","developers":["\u5d14\u8d44\u5766\u72ec\u7acb\u6e38\u620fTriztan IndieGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/header.jpg?t=1751052649","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257019729,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257019729/movie480.mp4?t=1750793784","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257019729/movie_max.mp4?t=1750793784"},"name":"English","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257019729/a5c32bfeb86a3d6359373209d01becbc16d44e73/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750793784","webm":{"480":"http://video.a